# Files that run on the Unix servers keep LF line ends on every checkout [2026-10-22].
# A Windows clone with core.autocrlf=true turned them into CR LF: job_unix.sh then created job files whose names end
# in a hidden CR, and the conf lines carried it too. These rules win over core.autocrlf.
*.sh            text eol=lf
*.ksh           text eol=lf
*.conf          text eol=lf
*.proposal      text eol=lf
**/out/unix/**  text eol=lf
